# M2 Bite1 权威全图：GDT 接管段寄存器 + IDT 异常接管（div 触发 #DE → 打印现场 → hlt）
# Style 1：control=紫 write=绿 data=橙；浅色；kernel = 信任边界
direction: right

vars: {
  d2-config: {
    layout-engine: elk
    theme-id: 0
  }
}

classes: {
  ext: {
    style: {
      fill: "#fff7ed"
      stroke: "#f97316"
      font-color: "#111827"
      border-radius: 10
      bold: true
      font-size: 13
    }
  }
  artifact: {
    style: {
      fill: "#eff6ff"
      stroke: "#3b82f6"
      font-color: "#111827"
      border-radius: 10
      bold: true
      font-size: 13
    }
  }
  kmod: {
    style: {
      fill: "#ffffff"
      stroke: "#8b5cf6"
      font-color: "#111827"
      border-radius: 10
      bold: true
      font-size: 13
    }
  }
  hw: {
    style: {
      fill: "#eff6ff"
      stroke: "#3b82f6"
      font-color: "#111827"
      border-radius: 10
      bold: true
      font-size: 13
    }
  }
  host: {
    style: {
      fill: "#fff7ed"
      stroke: "#f97316"
      font-color: "#111827"
      border-radius: 10
      bold: true
      font-size: 13
    }
  }
  e_ctrl: {
    style: {
      stroke: "#7c3aed"
      stroke-width: 2
      font-color: "#6b7280"
      bold: true
      font-size: 11
    }
  }
  e_write: {
    style: {
      stroke: "#10b981"
      stroke-width: 2
      font-color: "#6b7280"
      bold: true
      font-size: 11
    }
  }
  e_data: {
    style: {
      stroke: "#f97316"
      stroke-width: 2
      font-color: "#6b7280"
      bold: true
      font-size: 11
    }
  }
}

title: |md
  **M2 Bite1 架构（GDT / IDT / 异常现场打印）**

  构建：make build → kernel.iso ｜ 启动：SeaBIOS → Limine → kernel ｜ 新增：gdt 接管段寄存器、idt 接管向量 0~31，asm div 触发 #DE 验证全链路
| {
  near: top-center
  shape: text
}

# 构建 + 引导
docker: "构建容器\ncargo → xorriso" { class: ext }
iso: "kernel.iso\nelf + limine.conf" { class: artifact }
seabios: "SeaBIOS\nPOST + 启动" { class: ext }
limine: "Limine\nEl Torito + FB 协议" { class: ext }

docker -> iso: "make build" { class: e_write }
iso -> seabios: "qemu -cdrom" { class: e_data }
seabios -> limine: "El Torito" { class: e_ctrl }

# kernel 信任边界
kernel: "kernel（信任边界）" {
  style: {
    fill: "#faf5ff"
    stroke: "#8b5cf6"
    stroke-dash: 4
    border-radius: 16
    bold: true
    font-color: "#8b5cf6"
  }

  start: "_start\nmain.rs" { class: kmod }
  limine_fb: "limine_fb\n请求/响应" { class: kmod }
  console: "console\nfmt::Write + printk!" { class: kmod }
  kfont: "font\n8×16 glyph" { class: kmod }
  fb: "fb\nput_pixel + scroll_up" { class: kmod }
  serial: "serial\n16550（M0）" { class: kmod }
  gdt: "gdt\n扁平 GDT：null/code 0x08/data 0x10\nlgdt + retfq 重载段寄存器" { class: kmod }

  idt: "idt（idt.rs）" {
    style: {
      fill: "#ffffff"
      stroke: "#8b5cf6"
      stroke-dash: 3
      border-radius: 12
      bold: true
      font-color: "#8b5cf6"
    }
    table: "IDT 256 项\n向量 0~31 = interrupt gate" { class: kmod }
    stub: "异常 stub ×32\n压占位 err_code + vector" { class: kmod }
    common: "common_exception_entry\n压 15 个通用寄存器" { class: kmod }
    handler: "exception_handler（Rust）\n打印异常名 + 寄存器现场" { class: kmod }
    halt: "loop { hlt }\n停机" { class: kmod }
  }

  start -> limine_fb: "first_framebuffer()" { class: e_ctrl }
  start -> console: "init + printk!" { class: e_write }
  start -> serial: "早期降级直写" { class: e_write }
  console -> kfont: "glyph(ch)" { class: e_data }
  console -> fb: "put_pixel" { class: e_write }
  console -> serial: "镜像字节流（双写）" { class: e_write }

  start -> gdt: "gdt::init()" { class: e_ctrl }
  gdt -> idt.table: "KERNEL_CODE_SEL=0x08\n门描述符代码段" { class: e_data }
  start -> idt.table: "idt::init()：填表 + lidt" { class: e_ctrl }
}

limine -> kernel.start: "交付 CPU：长模式+高半区" { class: e_ctrl }
limine -> kernel.limine_fb: "填写 FB response\n(addr/几何/mask)" { class: e_data }

# 运行期异常路径：div → #DE → IDT[0] → stub → common → handler → printk! → hlt
cpu: "CPU\n执行 div → 异常 #DE" { class: hw }

kernel.start -> cpu: "asm div（0/0）" { class: e_ctrl }
cpu -> kernel.idt.stub: "查 IDT 向量 0 → 跳入 stub\n（CS=KERNEL_CODE_SEL）" { class: e_ctrl }
kernel.idt.stub -> kernel.idt.common: "jmp" { class: e_ctrl }
kernel.idt.common -> kernel.idt.handler: "call（rdi=栈帧）" { class: e_ctrl }
kernel.idt.handler -> kernel.console: "printk! 双写屏幕+串口" { class: e_write }
kernel.idt.handler -> kernel.idt.halt: "不返回" { class: e_ctrl }

# 外部硬件 / 宿主
vram: "线性显存\nLimine FB" { class: hw }
qemu_gfx: "qemu 图形\nscreendump" { class: host }
com1: "COM1\nI/O 0x3F8" { class: hw }
qemu_term: "qemu 终端\n-serial" { class: host }

kernel.fb -> vram: "RGB 像素" { class: e_write }
vram -> qemu_gfx: "guest→窗口" { class: e_data }
kernel.serial -> com1: "写 16550" { class: e_write }
com1 -> qemu_term: "文本流" { class: e_data }

legend: |md
  紫=控制/引导 · 绿=写 · 橙=数据/文本 ｜ 运行期路径：div → #DE → IDT[0] → stub → common → handler → printk! → hlt
| {
  near: bottom-center
  shape: text
}

footer: "Style 1 · d2/ELK · M2 Bite1（权威 SVG）" {
  near: bottom-right
  shape: text
  style.font-size: 11
  style.font-color: "#64748b"
}
